infographic list-column-simple-vertical-arrow
data
  title Escalate the contract only as far as the caller must decide
  desc Opaque is the default to keep; each step down is more API surface you maintain forever
  lists
    - label Opaque: no branch needed
      desc Promises only non-nil. Zero surface — the default you should fight to keep.
    - label Behaviour interface: capability check
      desc interface{ Timeout() bool } — ask the question without coupling to an identity.
    - label Sentinel: a yes/no branch (404?)
      desc Exported value matched by errors.Is. Dataless and permanent — never un-exportable.
    - label Typed error: branch needs data
      desc Struct read by errors.As. Richest contract; versions like any public type.
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #6366f1 #f59e0b #f43f5e
